\n\
Abhorrent Oculus is a 5-mana 5/5 flyer, which is actually a decent rate, but it requires exiling 6 cards from our graveyard. We currently have no way to get cards into our graveyard early, so this will be very hard to cast. It's essentially dead for the first several turns.\n\
\n\
