\n\
We could activate it now for another land, but we already have:\n\
- Blood Crypt (Black/Red) \n\
- Watery Grave (Blue/Black)\n\
- Swamp (Black)\n\
- Polluted Delta\n\
\n\
We have good black mana already. Getting another Swamp would make us even more black-heavy.\n\
\n\
We could potentially get an Island to improve blue/red balance, but we've already built our deck around black sources.\n\
\n\
