      "reasoning": "Turn 8 - we're one step closer to victory.\n\
\n\
Board:\n\
- 3/3 Emperor of Bones (untapped)\n\
- Blood Crypt, Watery Grave, Polluted Delta, Swamp (4 untapped lands)\n\
- Can produce {B}/{R}/{U}/{B} mana\n\
\n\
