- Opponent at 9 life\n\
\n\
Can we cast Archon of Cruelty this turn?\n\
\n\
Total mana available:\n\
1. Blood Crypt → {B} or {R}\n\
2. Watery Grave → {U} or {B} \n\
3. Swamp → {B}\n\
4. Polluted Delta → sacrifice to fetch Island/Swamp\n\
\n\
By sacrificing Polluted Delta, we can search for a basic Swamp or Island.\n\
\n\
Best play is to:\n\
1. Activate **Polluted Delta** to search for a Swamp\n\
2. Put the new Swamp onto battlefield\n\
3. Tap 4 lands + new Swamp = 5 mana sources\n\
4. Cast **Archon of Cruelty** (6BB)\n\
\n\
Wait - need 8 mana total for Archon (6 colorless + 2 black).\n\
\n\
We have 5 lands after fetching. That's enough!\n\
\n\
Sequence:\n\
- Activate Polluted Delta (sacrifice it, search for Swamp)\n\
- Swamp enters untapped (because we have a Swamp already in play via Spymaster's Vault)\n\
- Tap: \n\
  - Blood Crypt → {B} \n\
  - Watery Grave → {U}\n\
  - Original Swamp → {B}\n\
  - New Swamp → {B}\n\
  - This only gives us 4 mana\n\
\n\
I miscalculated.\n\
\n\
