      "reasoning": "We're in a combat scenario where the opponent controls **Yawgmoth, Thran Physician** and just used its ability to put a -1/-1 counter on our **Emperor of Bones**, which is now 2/2 (was 3/3 after combat damage triggered its counter gain). We're at 6 life, opponent at 9.\n\
\n\
