- **Walking Ballista** could be reactivated — but not a big threat if small\n\
- **Yawgmoth** — but opponent has another copy in graveyard? No — they have one on battlefield, one in exile (probably)\n\
\n\
Wait — opponent’s **Yawgmoth (p135)** is in *our* exile? No — in *their* graveyard.\n\
\n\
We exiled **Fatal Push** and **Unearth** in *our* exile.\n\
\n\
